  clientName: Mills
  jobDescription: "Build a 100-meter crossing that gives worker buses a direct route into Ironhaven's industrial district. Carry the bus safely from one bank to the other. Consider how the roadway, members, and supports work together, and use the test results to guide any changes."
  budget: 1000000
  liveLoadWeight: 12000
